---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Field Notes">
  <section class="container-narrow pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-24">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-6">About</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-8">Why this site exists.</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-stone">
      <p>
        I’ve spent years scribbling travel notes into a Chinese social app — quick reviews of
        a noodle shop, a hotel, a side street worth the detour. They lived there, until the
        algorithm buried them.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is the same material, rewritten in English, slowed down, and given a permanent home.
        Each post is a field note: what to eat, where to stay, how to get there, and whether
        I’d go back.
      </p>
      <p>
        Photos are mine unless noted otherwise. Prices are best-effort and shift quickly — check
        before you go.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
